{title: Be Glorified}
{key: G}
{x_source: chrd:be_glorified.chrd}

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]Be    [Am]glo - [G]ri - [F]fied;  [C]be    [G]glo - [Am]ri -  [G]fied;
Be    [Am]glo - [G]ri - [F]fied;  [C]be    [G]glo - [Am]ri -  [G]fied;
[Dm]Be  glo - ri - fied  in the [G]heav - ens,  [Dm]be  glo - ri - fied in the [G]earth;
[Dm]Be  glo - ri - fied  in this [G]tem - ple,  [C-C/B-D]Je -  sus,
[G-Bm-C]Je - sus,   [Am]be Thou [D]glo - ri - [G]fied,
[C-C/B-D]Je -  sus,   [G-Bm-C]Je - sus,   [Am]be Thou [D]glo - ri - [G]fied.

{comment: Verse 2}
[G]Wor - [Am]ship  [G]the  [F]Lord,  [C]wor - [G]ship t[Am]he    [G]Lord;
Wor - [Am]ship  [G]the  [F]Lord,  [C]wor - [G]ship t[Am]he    [G]Lord;
[Dm]Wor-ship the   Lord  in the [G]heav - ens,  [Dm]wor-ship  the  Lord in the [G]earth;
[Dm]Wor-ship  the  Lord  in this [G]tem - ple,  [C-C/B-D]Je -  sus,
[G-Bm-C]Je - sus,   [Am]be Thou [D]glo - ri - [G]fied,
[C-C/B-D]Je -  sus,   [G-Bm-C]Je - sus,  [Am]be Thou [D]glo - ri - [G]fied.
